[gd_scene format=3]

; The Foundry, east of the Bellows (map offset (346, -151)): the great foundry where the machines were cast, its abbot
; still at the anvil. Stepping onto the floor drops the gates behind and ahead (BossSeal) until the Founder (a boss
; placeholder) breaks. East, the vents breathe up from a shaft in the floor: only Heat plating goes down them, toward the
; core (the Threshold); ledges in the shaft climb back.

